        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Border security is primarily a matter of national survival.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Legal immigration reflects moral worth and personal integrity.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
